<title>USA: Milestone Scientific Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Milestone Scientific Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LIVINGSTON, N.J. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(For the three months ended March 31)</p>
<p>						  1997		  1996</p>
<p> Revenues				  $760,123	    $ 74,358</p>
<p> G&amp;A Expenses			     924,511	     416,189</p>
<p> R&amp;D Expenses				65,654		37,798</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		    (696,028)	   (333,442)</p>
<p> Loss Per Share			     (.14)		 (.07)</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					    4,840,527	   4,480,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 general and administrative expenses increased $508,322 due to its acquisition of Wisdom Oral Care Co in December 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is Milestone Scientific Inc.</p>
